# The champion with the dive armed at the standoff's own width (dive 3,
# divemargin 100): a party of the three FASTEST gathered units closes on
# the visible enemy ground mover whose land gun reaches at least 100
# world units beyond every land gun the army fields. dive16 (log
# 2026-09-13) priced the margin-free sibling evolve1-g4m2-dive3: three
# opener flips, every one a dive into artillery at 290 -- and one
# champion win lost to fifty-five re-drafts against plasma tanks (165)
# and missile mechs (190) that outrange the line's heavy tank (160) by a
# technicality, after which the game diverged and the enemy teched
# artillery on a seed it never had. Against a 160 line the threshold is
# 260: artillery and mech artillery (290) qualify, laser tanks and
# missile mechs (190) and plasma tanks (165) do not, so a seed on which
# no piece is ever fielded is the champion's match bit for bit -- the
# identity half of dive16b measures exactly that.
# Every other knob and every goals slot is the champion's exactly.
name evolve1-g4m2-dive3m100
goals extractorT1,extractorT1,extractorT1,c_tank,c_tank,c_tank,heavyTank,hoverTank
heavies heavyTank,heavyTank
